Chromium 158.0.8127.18 -> 158.0.8127.22, for the 158.0.8127.18 tarball.

158.0.8127.22 is a tag on the 158 branch (refs/branch-heads/8127@{#862}) that
has no source tarball (as of 2026-11-04). It adds 17 branch commits to
158.0.8127.18 (#845): contextual tasks and omnibox WebUI changes, and
PartitionAlloc's ThreadCache overflow churn during bulk purges.

Generated from the upstream diff between the tags (chromium/src
refs/tags/158.0.8127.18..158.0.8127.22; no dependency's DEPS revision
changed), as served by Gitiles, with scripts/chromium-delta.

Left out, as they cannot affect a Linux build: files not in the release
tarball, iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files, tests and docs,
translations, CI configuration, PGO pointers, DEPS.

Added: the tarball's stamp files for the new commit (stamps.py:
build/util/LASTCHANGE{,.committime} and gpu/config/gpu_lists_version.h;
commit 58b666ad521f748090829ba302d391bfd3c784cf, refs/branch-heads/8127@{#862}).
Skia's and Dawn's stamps and build/util/MINIBRANCH don't change.

Checked: applies to the 158.0.8127.18 tarball; chrome/VERSION becomes
158.0.8127.22; every patched source file is byte-identical to its version
at the tag; it adds no files; the 158.0.8127.18 tarball's non-git files are
all classified (tarball-generated.py with generated.conf).

Apply with git apply.

